right. Lookshy is capable of SO much more. I can help them become the masters of death they are destined to be.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>aye that's the case.<br /> also thank you for posting something that has to do with the thread <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> seriously had it been one more post on that argument i would probably have snapped and gone and hidden in my comic thread. I mean it's more or less only me, guru, possibly leo and dogskull in there...<br /> <br /> now I'm the one going of topic... damn it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T11:56:07-07:00","id":668557,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=668552#post668552\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;My deathlord is right. Lookshy is capable of SO much more. I can help them become the masters of death they are destined to be.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh. Oh DAAAANG. This legit made me sit up. I'm gonna play an Abyssal from Lookshy that wants to use armies of ghosts to back up it's flagging strength.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When one is accustomed to privilege, equality seems like oppression.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7195-tidygamer","name":"TidyGamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7195_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"644"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T11:58:38-07:00","id":668558,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TidyGamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=668557#post668557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh. Oh DAAAANG. This legit made me sit up. I'm gonna play an Abyssal from Lookshy that wants to use armies of ghosts to back up it's flagging strength.</div> </div> </div> </div>i think there was a mention in the underworld compass of how there are a lot of pretty well armed lookshyan ghosts in the underworld version of lookshy, ghosts that would be more than ready to take up arms and defend lookshy to their last breath... eeer... second, last breath?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T12:00:29-07:00","id":668560,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TidyGamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=668557#post668557\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh. Oh DAAAANG. This legit made me sit up. I'm gonna play an Abyssal from Lookshy that wants to use armies of ghosts to back up it's flagging strength.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Lookshy is my favorite city in Creation for a reason. I love role playing Military based cultures. And those cultures are usually strongly tied to death and Sacrifice. Honestly, there probably should be more Daybreaks Exalting from the Seventh Legion than Twilights.<br /> <br /> &quot;I love the smell of soulsteel in the morning.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T12:06:37-07:00","id":668568,"title":"","content":"Taking my own suggestion on 'How to Abyssal Sig'<br /> Here\u2019s my suggestions:<br /> * The Bloody-Handed General (Loyalist):<br /> A Daybreak Caste who specializes in mass combat. In life, she served as a distinguished general for the Perfect of Paragon, with a distinguished career. Not the most personally martially inclined (although no slouch in a fight), she was more noted as being a brilliant tactician and strategiest, inventing new gambits and often anticipating her opponents traps and counter-trapping them. She lived for the praise and the limelight, easily acquired in her youth and middle age; lost when she was forced into retirement. Old now, a fever took her\u2026<br /> <br /> Except the First and Forsaken Lion knows talent when he sees it. The Blood-Handed General is one of his most loyal servants, leading the Lion\u2019s war machine against their neighbors, and basks in the adulation of her immortal troops.<br /> <br /> * The Fourth Terror of Night Eternal (Malcontent)<br /> A Day Caste who specializes in inspiring revolutions. In life, he was a nobody; a slave-farmer in a village near Whitewall, he had no great aspirations. That changed when a priest-magistrate from the city came through his village, seizing the salt and supplies needed for his family to survive the winters for repairing the Great Northern Road. He struck the magistrate, and was summarily hanged by his guards, his goods and family forfeit to the City of Whitewall for striking it\u2019s representative. As he was dancing on the impromptu gallows, he heard the Bishop of the Chalcedony Thurible whisper an offer- join me and you will have your vengeance.<br /> <br /> Since that time, The Fourth Terror of Night Eternal has moved through Whitewall, finding the desperate, the criminal, the forgotten of that sterile city, and spreading seditious words. Additionally, he walks more openly under a false name as a foreign prince, nominally representing the interests of a distant land while encouraging the upper classes to grow only more brutal, paranoid and repressive. Bloody revolution that will crack the walls of Whitewall and leave the city ripe for the taking seems to be only a matter of time.<br /> <br /> But The Fourth Terror has a weakness now; he has fallen in love with a young nobleman who works in charity for the underclasses. At first he tried to divert his love away from his mission, but now finds himself questioning it entirely; he well knows the pain and destruction that will accompany this revolution, and is certain his lover will perish in those flames. He continues for the moment, but with far less fervor than before.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My Storyteller Vault releases!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/269728/Sorcerous-Ways-Mystic-Martial-Arts\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerous Ways: Mystic Martial Arts</a> - Punch people for magic power!<br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/252892/These-Mean-Streets\" target=\"_blank\">These Mean Streets</a> - Advise and systems for street-level punk-noir Vampire larp","edited":{"userid":169,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/169-wastevens","user":"wastevens","date":". 09-17-2015, 03:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/169-wastevens","name":"wastevens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar169_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"939"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T12:07:47-07:00","id":668570,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xanroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=668524#post668524\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">sigh... can we please go back to what this thread is supposed to be about now and not an argument that begun over a trench-coat and a fedora?</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Shit, this guy's got an opinion that goes against the groupthink! Shut him down for the crime of thinking differently!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4801-frostav","name":"Frostav","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T12:11:43-07:00","id":668581,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by 