/> <br /> The trappings are fine, as long as they mean more than &quot;huh, they dress all goth and shit mom&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> This goes back to the often mentioned request of more cultural details for the different areas of Creation. If we have more information on the Funeral Rites of Creation's different cultures, it would be easier to fill in the blanks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T13:42:30-07:00","id":668761,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=668588#post668588\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Back on topic,<br /> <br /> Wastevens, I like your character concepts, since they include intimacies. I think Abyssals need more Intimacies and be less Psychopathic.</div> </div> </div> </div>&lt;.&lt;<br /> &gt;.&gt;<br /> my concepts???<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T13:44:55-07:00","id":668764,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xanroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=668761#post668761\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &lt;.&lt;<br /> &gt;.&gt;<br /> my concepts???</div> </div> </div> </div>Did I miss read and they were your concepts? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T13:53:37-07:00","id":668772,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=668764#post668764\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Did I miss read and they were your concepts? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>probably not, may have been some misinterpretations somewhere, I'm easily confused you see and sometimes i just miss things. when you mentioned abyssals that have intimacies as reason for their battle i thought you ment the one i gave as an example earlier<i> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T14:04:09-07:00","id":668780,"title":"","content":"I think the Abyssal themes, being gothic by default, don't lend themselves so easily to shamanism. I think the best fit would be that Deadspeaker role they had in MoEP or whatever, intermediating between the dead and the living. Lunars do the same kind of thing, but closer to the human world and interfacing with other realms as well (Heave and the Wyld, probably). A Lunar Shaman sends her spirit out on a Wyld vision quest, an Abyssal sleeps on a recent grave so she can find its inhabitant in her dreams and interrogate them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TidyGamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=668742#post668742\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Spine chains, necro rhinos, the corpses of 77 soldiers stitched together into a giant zombie ogre and all that work just fine as actual statted creatures. I just dislike the point buy build a monster workshop systems.<br /> <br /> But ugh, &quot;Daybreak bringing his Zombie Rhino in for repairs the same way I'd bring my truck into a car mechanic to get my oil changed&quot;? UUUUUGH.</div> </div> </div> </div>I definitely want to keep spine chains and hand grenades and things, but I wouldn't mind if they made them into necromancy spells or something. Like the necromantic version of Minions of the Eyeless Face or whatever.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>But sexually.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1797-ellis","name":"Ellis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1797_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T14:13:52-07:00","id":668787,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ellis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=668780#post668780\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think the Abyssal themes, being gothic by default, don't lend themselves so easily to shamanism. I think the best fit would be that Deadspeaker role they had in MoEP or whatever, intermediating between the dead and the living. Lunars do the same kind of thing, but closer to the human world and interfacing with other realms as well (Heave and the Wyld, probably). A Lunar Shaman sends her spirit out on a Wyld vision quest, an Abyssal sleeps on a recent grave so she can find its inhabitant in her dreams and interrogate them.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was thinking more &quot;dressed as a Shaman&quot; as in dead animal parts and bones as trappings of death. I'm not sure if there is a better term for that than &quot;Shaman.&quot; I was originally using the term &quot;voodoo&quot;, but that google image search leads to tophats, which messes with my suspension of belief for the Exalted setting.<br /> <br /> (Though my Midnight Abyssal Concept I <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=668289#post668289\">posted earlie</a>r is definitely a Shaman, but character concept is different than a splat theme. )<br /> <br /> As I said, that overlaps with Lunar themes. (I don't mean cast Meekrat Steals the Stoplight! I swear!) Maybe I need have my own batman meme slap me and start another thread on this.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T14:18:39-07:00","id":668796,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=668787#post668787\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I was thinking more &quot;dressed as a Shaman&quot; as in dead animal parts and bones as trappings of death. I'm not sure if there is a better term for that than &quot;Shaman.&quot; I was originally using the term &quot;voodoo&quot;, but that google image search leads to tophats, which messes with my suspension of belief for the Exalted setting.<br /> <br /> As I said, that overlaps with Lunar themes. (I don't mean cast Meekrat Steals the Stoplight! I swear!) Maybe I need have my own batman meme slap me and start another thread on this.</div> </div> </div> </div>hmmm i think i sense where you're going, you want a kind of Witch doctor type? a different kind of shaman? the kind that are usually depicted as the curse throwing head shrinking type? or am is my imagination out on a bicycle hike with the unconquered sun?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T14:22:21-07:00","id":668797,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xanroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=668796#post668796\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">hmmm i think i sense where you're going, you want a kind of Witch doctor type? a different kind of shaman? the kind that are usually depicted as the curse throwing head shrinking type? or am is my imagination out on a bicycle hike with the unconquered sun?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> From wikipedia:<br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><i>a person regarded as having access to, and influence in, the world of good and evil spirits, especially among some peoples of northern Asia and North America. </i><br /> <br /> So my Midnight, before exaltation, was the Tribal Shaman that acted as an intermediary between the living and the dead for his ancestor worshiping tribe. </span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T14:25:56-07:00","id":668802,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=668797#post668797\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> From wikipedia:<br /> <span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><i>a person regarded as having access to, and influence in, the world of good and evil spirits, especially among some peoples of northern Asia and North America. </i><br /> <br /> So my Midnight, before exaltation, was the Tribal Shaman that acted as an intermediary between the living and the dead for his ancestor worshiping tribe. </span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>that works. Btw which one was it you mentioned earlier as a concept you liked? (I'm a bit of a insecure person when it comes to me mucking up, especially something as bad as taking someone else's credit, I don't want to do such a thing)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T14:29:43-07:00","id":668804,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xanroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=668796#post668796\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">hmmm i think i sense where you're going, you want a kind of Witch doctor type? a different kind of shaman? the kind that are usually depicted as the curse throwing head shrinking type? or am is my imagination out on a bicycle hike with the unconquered sun?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ha! I answered the wrong question.<br /> <br /> So my image is of a more primal look for trappings of the dead: Feathers, animal skins, bones from ancestors. An Abyssal would engage in Animal Sacrifice and would call on his ghostly contacts for information. He would have Zombies at his side to help him fight his battles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T14:33:02-07:00","id":668806,"title":"","content":"I didn't quote it, so it is easy to get confused. Here are the concepts with the intimacies I liked:<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wastevens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=668568#post668568\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Taking my own suggestion on 'How to Abyssal Sig'<br /> Here\u2019s my suggestions:<br /> * The Bloody-Handed General (Loyalist):<br /> A Daybreak Caste who specializes in mass combat. In life, she served as a distinguished general for the Perfect of Paragon, with a distinguished career. Not the most personally martially inclined (although no slouch in a fight), she was more noted as being a brilliant tactician and strategiest, inventing new gambits and often anticipating her opponents traps and counter-trapping them. She lived for the praise and the limelight, easily acquired in her youth and middle age; lost when she was forced into retirement. Old now, a fever took her\u2026<br /> <br /> Except the First and Forsaken Lion knows talent when he sees it. The Blood-Handed General is one of his most loyal servants, leading the Lion\u2019s war machine against their neighbors, and basks in the adulation of her immortal troops.<br /> <br /> * The Fourth Terror of Night Eternal (Malcontent)<br /> A Day Caste who specializes in inspiring revolutions. In life, he was a nobody; a slave-farmer in a village near Whitewall, he had no great aspirations. That changed when a priest-magistrate from the city came through his village, seizing the salt and supplies needed for his family to survive the winters for repairing the Great Northern Road. He struck the magistrate, and was summarily hanged by his guards, his goods and family forfeit to the City of Whitewall for striking it\u2019s representative. As he was dancing on the impromptu gallows, he heard the Bishop of the Chalcedony Thurible whisper an offer- join me and you will have your vengeance.<br /> <br /> Since that time, The Fourth Terror of Night Eternal has moved through Whitewall, finding the desperate, the criminal, the forgotten of that sterile city, and spreading seditious words. Additionally, he walks more openly under a false name as a foreign prince, nominally representing the interests of a distant land while encouraging the upper classes to grow only more brutal, paranoid and repressive. Bloody revolution that will crack the walls of Whitewall and leave the city ripe for the taking seems to be only a matter of time.<br /> <br /> But The Fourth Terror has a weakness now; he has fallen in love with a young nobleman who works in charity for the underclasses. At first he tried to divert his love away from his mission, but now finds himself questioning it entirely; he well knows the pain and destruction that will accompany this revolution, and is certain his lover will perish in those flames. He continues for the moment, but with far less fervor than before.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is my edited post from before with my Midnight Character concept:<br /> <br /> <br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=668289#post668289\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have an idea for a Pro-Ghost, but Anti-Deathlord Abyssal, but was never clear on where they would stand on Oblivion. Ghost don't seem to like Agents of Oblivion but at the same time, a ghost wouldn't exist if it wasn't for Oblivion?<br /> <br /> To add some background to my character concept, the Crimson Shaman was a shaman of an ancestor worshiping tribe in the East. His tribe has difficulties from some of the local gods who want the tribe to worship them not their ancestors. The gods try to assassinate the shaman and his apprentice, so in desperation Crimson accepts the Deathlord's offer and exalts as a Midnight Caste. Crimson exacts revenge on the gods and the ancestral ghosts of his tribe convince him to abandon his deathlord, leave the tribe, and head to the underworld to be a traveling ronin who helps ghosts out.<br /> <br /> The Crimson Shaman has no desire to destroy Creation, but will violently defend the underworld and any Ancestor worshiping cults. I don't see him having any issues with Solars or wishing to become one. Yet his negative intimacy with the Gods of the Terrestrial Bureaucracy might cause conflict with the Creation based Exalts.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-17T14:40:20-07:00","id":668839,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=668806#post668806\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I didn't quote it, so it is easy to get confused. Here are the concepts with the intimacies I liked:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> This is my edited post from before with my Midnight Character concept:<br /> <br /> <br /> \u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>aaaah ok my apologies to wastevens. did not mean to accidentally steal credit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.