__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm sorry, I literally can't tell if you're being serious with this one.<br /> <br /> EDIT: I mean, what do you find cool about taking something mysterious and making it mundane. I wouldn't exactly call living in a bachelor pad in Heaven and slapping the UCS a couple of high-fives every morning before you go out into the Wyld for your daily Behemoth slaying before breakfast.</div> </div> </div> </div>The person you're asking has been banned, so I wouldn't expect an answer soon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T06:16:25-07:00","id":669594,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wastevens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=669579#post669579\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">My own comment would be to make her less chesty and a bit less leggy; her midsection seems unusually short because of those two things.<br /> <br /> But the crows, bloody hands and red eyes are awesome. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>okidoki, I will keep that in mind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T06:41:54-07:00","id":669607,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TidyGamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=668742#post668742\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Spine chains, necro rhinos, the corpses of 77 soldiers stitched together into a giant zombie ogre and all that work just fine as actual statted creatures. I just dislike the point buy build a monster workshop systems.<br /> <br /> But ugh, &amp;quot;Daybreak bringing his Zombie Rhino in for repairs the same way I'd bring my truck into a car mechanic to get my oil changed&amp;quot;? UUUUUGH.</div> </div> </div> </div>For them, I think at a certain point it makes sense for it to be somewhat mundane. If you're a military engineer, at a certain point keeping your stuff running properly SHOULD be a matter of rote checks and spot fixing. <br /> <br /> The discussion in that comic wouldn't be out of place with Romans discussing fixing a damaged ballista or Lookshy's sorcerer-technicians getting to work on a warstrider with battle damage. <br /> <br /> Maybe the process of maintaining should be more fantastical (reminded of the reference to a 3e emperor who Prevents revolts using his one warstrider that is slowly becoming harder and harder to field due to maintenance) but there's a big gap between &quot;taking your truck in&quot; and &quot;chant for 6 hours before pressing the sacred ON rune&quot; like in 40k.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Chicanery-No: If a player uses this Charm in an abusive or exploitative manner, the ST may punch him right in the goddamn face.&quot; --TheDementedOne<br /> <br /> &quot;Happiness is <i>very</i> brittle and short-lived in the Exalted community, because <i>ressentiment</i> is our cultural touchstone.&quot; --Gayo","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3420-zelbinnean","name":"Zelbinnean","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3420_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5884"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T09:46:35-07:00","id":669778,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gonzo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=669136#post669136\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hey, that's Coatlicue, but she's not a death deity really. Still her image is very inspiring.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, neither is Xipe Totec I think. The theme of my post was &quot;actual human parts as decoration/clothing.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xanroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=669357#post669357\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">btw is the thread stuck saying that the latest post is always by Zelbinnean for anyone else?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, I've been having that sort of trouble on several threads this month.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","user":"Erinys","date":". 09-18-2015, 12:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T10:10:13-07:00","id":669797,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TidyGamer</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=668742#post668742\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Spine chains, necro rhinos, the corpses of 77 soldiers stitched together into a giant zombie ogre and all that work just fine as actual statted creatures. I just dislike the point buy build a monster workshop systems.<br /> <br /> But ugh, &quot;Daybreak bringing his Zombie Rhino in for repairs the same way I'd bring my truck into a car mechanic to get my oil changed&quot;? UUUUUGH.</div> </div> </div> </div>Since they &quot;got rid&quot; of magitech by simply rolling some of them into and replacing the rest it with &quot;regular&quot; artefacts*, I'd guess the same applies to necrotech: Rolled into craft and sorcerous workings. You can still torture a hundred people to death, stitch their corpses together using their sinews and turn the whole mess into a ship that repairs itself by grabbing and incoperating floating corpses into its hull. But now it won't be called necrotech, it's &quot;just&quot; an artefact constructed using necromancy.<br /> <br /> *: Apologies for calling an artefact &quot;regular&quot; - they're never supposed to be regular, hence getting rid of the magiteck&quot;artefact divide.<br /> <br /> <br /> *","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Silencing Whisper, <i>Eclipse</i>; Amethyst, <i>Changing Moon</i>;<br /> Daughter of Charcoal and Ash, <i>Dusk</i>, and her <i>Full Moon </i>sister;<br /> Broken Crystal, <i>Infernal </i>(<i>Night</i>-, or maybe <i>Twilight</i>-equivalent).","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7262-amakawa-yuuto","name":"Amakawa Yuuto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7262_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"407"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T20:56:19-07:00","id":670445,"title":"","content":"First off, I really want to apologise for what I did to the thread, I wasn't meaning it to be serious and expected at most a &quot;Andonno, stop being silly&quot;, not a multi-page dissertation on appropriate thematics.<br /> That out of the way.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zelbinnean</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=669607#post669607\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For them, I think at a certain point it makes sense for it to be somewhat mundane. If you're a military engineer, at a certain point keeping your stuff running properly SHOULD be a matter of rote checks and spot fixing.<br /> <br /> The discussion in that comic wouldn't be out of place with Romans discussing fixing a damaged ballista or Lookshy's sorcerer-technicians getting to work on a warstrider with battle damage.<br /> <br /> Maybe the process of maintaining should be more fantastical (reminded of the reference to a 3e emperor who Prevents revolts using his one warstrider that is slowly becoming harder and harder to field due to maintenance) but there's a big gap between &quot;taking your truck in&quot; and &quot;chant for 6 hours before pressing the sacred ON rune&quot; like in 40k.</div> </div> </div> </div>Can confirm, am military tech. You pull enough of anything apart and you get bored of it. (Ugh, <i>another</i>, M113AS4 drive replacement? STOP GETTING BOGGED). But I could see a sorcerer-technician adding &quot;Praise the Machine Spirit/Least God for three hours a day each day of calibration&quot; as required maintenance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>As you are now, so once was I,<br /> As I am now, so you will be.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/285-andonno","name":"Andonno","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-18T21:25:24-07:00","id":670457,"title":"","content":"Man, not one of these Abyssals are really jumping out at me. Like they're not BAD or anything, but they're just missing a certain sort of..I dunno Pizazz. Maybe I'm just tired.<br /> <br /> This is usually the point where I start trying to port La Parka or Mil Muertes into the setting. Usually.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-19T00:27:54-07:00","id":670531,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zelbinnean</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=669607#post669607\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For them, I think at a certain point it makes sense for it to be somewhat mundane. If you're a military engineer, at a certain point keeping your stuff running properly SHOULD be a matter of rote checks and spot fixing.<br /> <br /> The discussion in that comic wouldn't be out of place with Romans discussing fixing a damaged ballista or Lookshy's sorcerer-technicians getting to work on a warstrider with battle damage.<br /> <br /> Maybe the process of maintaining should be more fantastical (reminded of the reference to a 3e emperor who Prevents revolts using his one warstrider that is slowly becoming harder and harder to field due to maintenance) but there's a big gap between &quot;taking your truck in&quot; and &quot;chant for 6 hours before pressing the sacred ON rune&quot; like in 40k.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that about 80% of what I dislike about that comic is the blase attitude the (presumably) mortal technician has with interacting with the Daybreak.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When one is accustomed to privilege, equality seems like oppression.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7195-tidygamer","name":"TidyGamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7195_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"644"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-19T00:49:10-07:00","id":670551,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Andonno</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=670445#post670445\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">First off, I really want to apologise for what I did to the thread, I wasn't meaning it to be serious and expected at most a &quot;Andonno, stop being silly&quot;, not a multi-page dissertation on appropriate thematics.<br /> That out of the way.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Can confirm, am military tech. You pull enough of anything apart and you get bored of it. (Ugh, <i>another</i>, M113AS4 drive replacement? STOP GETTING BOGGED). But I could see a sorcerer-technician adding &quot;Praise the Machine Spirit/Least God for three hours a day each day of calibration&quot; as required maintenance.</div> </div> </div> </div>it's ok, no one could have expected things to turn out like they did.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-19T01:06:12-07:00","id":670561,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Xanroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/667904-lets-design-abyssals-sigs?p=670551#post670551\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">it's ok, no one could have expected things to turn out like they did.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know man, it's pretty much par for the course when it comes to the Exalted subforum. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I mean it could have turned out worse. There was a time when it seemed every thread would end up revealing itself to a lunar thread in disguise.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>When one is accustomed to privilege, equality seems like oppression.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7195-tidygamer","name":"TidyGamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7195_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"644"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-19T01:10:02-07:00","id":670564,"title":"","content":"Well, that's because they're master shapeshifters, see.<br /> <br /> Don't worry. When the 3rd ed book hits, there won't be these kind of arguments. It will all be about how the other person has completely misunderstood what the rules say, and how this charm is/isn't totally broken.\u200b<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-19T03:06:04-07:00","id":670661,"title":"","content":"Here is the &quot;Herald of Ashes&quot;, the one that made the description and story for this guy did it by messaging me, so that's why there's no herald of ashes description around in the post.<br /> I do not know if the one that made Herald wishes to remain anonymous or not so until i hear otherwise, said creator will remain anonymous.<br /> *i have now been informed that he doesn't mind being known so to speak.<br /> <br /> the creator of the concept is Rahu444<br /> <br /> big picture, with b