5-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1072"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-01T08:54:07-08:00","id":797838,"title":"","content":"Soo I decided to start the new year by getting to work on this thread again. And what better way to do that than to draw a really, REALLY! unlucky Moonshadow caste...<br /> say hello to the Moonshadow caste that now a'days is only known as &quot;Subject Seven&quot; (anyone have a name laying around that she could have had before she pissed of the Reaper?)<br /> <br /> Big and quite bloody picture, enjoy! as always link is in the first post!<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://pre13.deviantart.net/c136/th/pre/i/2016/001/3/d/subject__seven_by_xanroth-d9mbg9l.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> anyhow. Subject Seven is a &quot;servant&quot; of &quot;the Reaper of the Mortal Harvest&quot;... she didn't really like his &quot;experiments&quot; finding them pretty damn disturbing... So she gave him a piece of her mind so to say (look I've barely slept today so I may be a bit wacky today)... AAAAAND he responded by making her his nr 1 test subject... aka he decided to see how much crap you could put an exalt through before they become COMPLETELY INSANE! Sooo yeah she's been experimented on A LOT!.. and if you wonder what's up with her hands well... that's how your hands look when someone forcefully enlarges your hands and FORGES! a pair of manacles ONTO your hands... She could actually be quite an interesting character to have in a campaign for social characters.. revolving around trying to rehabilitate a victim of the Reapers &quot;loving care&quot;... but yeah she hates the reaper beyond everything...<br /> enjoy! and happy new year to Y'all!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm making the Tales of Exalts webcomic<br /> <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/50854781/tales-of-exalts\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...ales-of-exalts</a><br /> alchemical report <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/54812164/Alchemical-Report\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/galler...hemical-Report</a><br /> the fall <a href=\"http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall\" target=\"_blank\">http://xanroth.deviantart.com/gallery/55265686/the-fall</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4455-xanroth","name":"Xanroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4455_2.p